---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy"
  description="The terms that apply to your use of the Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy website, including donations, intellectual property, and acceptable use."
  canonicalPath="/terms-of-use/"
>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="pt-40 pb-16 bg-brand-dark relative overflow-hidden" style="padding-top: 10rem;">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-brand-red/5 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6">TERMS OF <span class="text-brand-red">USE</span></h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl border-l-4 border-brand-red pl-6">
                The terms that apply when you use this website.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="py-16 bg-brand-black">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Effective date: 30 August 2026</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                This website is operated by Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy ("Velokhaya", "we", "us"), a registered
                non-profit organisation based in Khayelitsha, Cape Town, South Africa. By using this website you
                agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with them, please do not use the website.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">2. Purpose of this website</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                The website provides information about Velokhaya's programmes, impact, and ways to support our work.
                Content is provided for general information only and does not constitute professional advice of any
                kind.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">3. Donations</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Card donations are processed by Yoco, an independent third-party payment provider, on Yoco's own
                platform and subject to Yoco's terms. Donations are voluntary gifts to support our work. If you
                believe a donation was made in error, contact us at
                <a href="mailto:sipho@velokhaya.com" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">sipho@velokhaya.com</a>
                and we will work with you in good faith to resolve it.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">4. Intellectual property</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Unless otherwise indicated, the content of this website — including text, photographs, logos, and
                design — belongs to Velokhaya or its licensors. You may view and share it for personal,
                non-commercial purposes with attribution. Any other use, including commercial use of our name, logo,
                or athlete imagery, requires our prior written permission.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">5. Acceptable use</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                You agree not to misuse the website — including attempting to gain unauthorised access, interfering
                with its operation, scraping content at scale, or using it to transmit unlawful, misleading, or
                harmful material.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">6. Third-party links</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                The website links to third-party sites and services (such as social media platforms, map services,
                and our payment provider). We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content
                or practices.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">7. Disclaimers and liability</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                We work to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date, but it is provided "as is"
                without warranties of any kind, express or implied. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Velokhaya
                will not be liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or inability to use, this
                website. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits any rights you may have under South African law,
                including the Consumer Protection Act, that cannot lawfully be excluded.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">8. Privacy</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> explains how
                we handle personal information collected through this website and forms part of these terms.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">9. Governing law</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa, and the South African courts
                have jurisdiction over any dispute relating to them.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">10. Changes to these terms</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                We may update these terms from time to time. The effective date at the top shows when they were last
                revised. Continued use of the website after changes means you accept the updated terms.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">11. Contact</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Questions about these terms? Email us at
                <a href="mailto:sipho@velokhaya.com" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">sipho@velokhaya.com</a>
                or visit our <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">contact page</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
